37946>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
37946>>>                Case Break
37947>>>
37947>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37947>>>
37947>>>        Case End
37947>>>
37947>>>        Send SetActionButtons
